    5: { sharp: "Then tell me what goes wrong. Teach me.", dry: "Then teach me.", loud: "Then TELL me what goes wrong! Go on! TEACH me!", soft: "Then tell me what goes wrong. Go on, teach me.", odd: "Then tell me what goes wrong. Class is in session." },
