      loud: "{a} wants to act like it was NOTHING! It WASN'T nothing! It was my NAME in {a}'s mouth when I wasn't THERE!", soft: "{a} wants to act like it was nothing. It wasn't nothing. It was my name in {a}'s mouth when I wasn't there.",
